        "created_at": "2018-06-26T18:18:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's funny, I was reading people speculating about Headlong and I was about to say, \"He's probably connected to Parse, he's got the little arrows and his costume is…\"</p>\n<p>And then I realized that his costume reminds me of <a href=\"https://reafdebrief.files.wordpress.com/2016/03/yjep10-1.png?w=600&amp;amp;h=338\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Red Arrow</a>, and that was colouring my impressions. Yeah, he does look like a speedster.&nbsp;</p>",
